{"unit_id":"Perfirstvito__dsh-prospector#card-zh","repo":"Perfirstvito/dsh-prospector","commit":"ac108dee911e09c66d9ba47e8a2bdbb05676a1e8","type":"card","lang":"zh","text":"dsh-prospector 为 DSH agent 提供 GitHub 调研工具和 /research 命令。工具可搜索仓库、读取 README 与源码、列出文件树，并将候选浅克隆到本地工作区。研究命令按 low、medium、high 深度引导 agent 从想法整理候选并形成实现计划，/gh-login 可查看登录状态。适合比较开源方案、检查代码和规划功能的用户。REST 读取可用 GH_TOKEN、GITHUB_TOKEN 或 gh 登录凭据；需要 gh 与 git，克隆写入工作区。","source":"generated","evidence":["src/index.ts:165-249","src/index.ts:286-390","src/rest.ts:176-216"]}
